     "dur": 3.0,
     "camMove": true,
     "cam": "at:640,420,1.4",
     "sfx": "fire",
     "swell": true,
     "flash": "#ffb43a"
    },
    {
     "who": "narrator",
     "text": "She raised her breath through her body, and a fire rose from within her. And Sati was gone.",
     "text_hi": "उन्होंने अपनी प्राणवायु को ऊपर उठाया, और भीतर से एक अग्नि उठी। और सती चली गईं।",
