     "cam": "wide",
     "sfx": "roar"
    },
    {
     "who": "ganas",
     "text": "She is dead! Kill Daksha! Destroy the sacrifice!",
     "text_hi": "वे नहीं रहीं! दक्ष को मारो! यज्ञ नष्ट कर दो!",
     "cam": "two:gana,gana2"
    },
    {
     "who": "narrator",
     "text": "Bhrigu poured an offering into the fire, chanting from the Yajur Veda. And from the flames rose an army of fiery warriors, the Ribhus.",
     "text_hi": "भृगु ने यजुर्वेद के मंत्र पढ़ते हुए अग्नि में आहुति डाली। और ज्वालाओं से अग्निमय योद्धाओं की एक सेना उठी, ऋभु।",
     "cam": "mid:bhrigu"
    },
    {
     "text": "",
     "dur": 1.4,
     "cam": "wide",
     "sfx": "boom",
     "flash": true,
     "shake": 10,
     "bang": "WHOOOSH!|धधक!",
     "bangPos": "900,160"
    },
    {
     "who": "narrator",
     "text": "Shiva's ganas were driven away. Many had already died of grief beside Sati.",
     "text_hi": "शिव के गण खदेड़ दिए गए। कई तो सती के शोक में पहले ही प्राण दे चुके थे।",
     "cam": "wide",
     "capPos": "bottom"
    },
    {
     "who": "skyvoice",
     "text": "Daksha, you fool! You did not honour Sati, the mother of the worlds, nor Shiva, the father. Your sacrifice will be destroyed. Not even the gods can save you now.",
     "text_hi": "दक्ष, मूर्ख! तुमने न जगन्माता सती का सम्मान किया, न जगत्पिता शिव का। तुम्हारा यज्ञ नष्ट होगा। अब देवता भी तुम्हें नहीं बचा सकते।",
     "cam": "wide",
     "sky": true,
     "sfx": "thunder"
    },
    {
     "who": "narrator",
     "text": "And far away, on Kailasa, Narada went to tell Shiva what had happened.",
     "text_hi": "और दूर कैलास पर, नारद शिव को यह सब बताने पहुँचे।",
     "cam": "mid:daksha",
     "capPos": "bottom"
    }
